 "Círculo azul": "Blue circle",
 "Obligatorio": "Mandatory",
 "Uso de casco": "Hard hat required",
 "Triángulo amarillo": "Yellow triangle",
 "Advertencia": "Warning",
 "Riesgo eléctrico": "Electrical hazard",
